<!-- BEGIN generated by tools/race_ships.py -->
<!-- The classes and names of the blueprints it makes. Don't edit these by hand: change tools/race_ships.py and run it again. -->
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_class">Chonktorus</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_name">The Chonktorus</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_desc">The Torus, grown into a drone carrier: three drones systems with three slots each, a hold full of drone parts and a crew of Engi to keep them flying.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_class">Chonkudicator</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_name">The Chonkudicator</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_desc">The Adjudicator, made into a fortress: three shields systems whose layers stack, two Zoltan shields and a crew of Zoltan to power its systems.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_class">Chonkila Monster</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_name">The Chonkila Monster</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_desc">The Gila Monster, built to board: two teleporters with pads for four, two medbays to patch up the boarders when they get back, and a crew of Mantis to send over.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_class">Man of Chonk</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_name">The Man of Chonk</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_desc">The Man of War, all eyes and minds: two sensors systems, two hacking systems and two mind control systems, all installed, and a crew of Slugs who see everything anyway.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_class">Chonkwark</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_name">The Chonkwark</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_desc">The Bulwark, with guns to match its armour: three weapons systems full of missiles, more hull than any other ship its size, Rock Plating and a crew of Rocks.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_class">Chonkruos</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_name">The Chonkruos</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_desc">The Kruos, for a crew that doesn't breathe: no oxygen system at all, two backup batteries, two hacking systems and a teleporter, all for a crew of Lanius.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_class">Chonkravais</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_name">The Chonkravais</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_desc">The Bravais, made to vanish: two cloaking systems, so it can cloak again while one cools down, Crystal weapons and a crew of Crystals.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_2_class">Chonk-Tail</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_2_name">The Chonk-Tail</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_2_desc">The Red-Tail, as big as the Chonkestrel: two weapons systems with four Basic Lasers each, two of most other systems, a big medbay and a crew from all over.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_2_class">Chonkvortex</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_2_name">The Chonkvortex</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_2_desc">The Vortex, with drones doing the work of a crew: three drones systems full of anti-personnel and repair drones, and only three Engi to look after them.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_2_class">Chonkoether</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_2_name">The Chonkoether</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_2_desc">The Noether, all ions behind its shields: three shields systems, two Zoltan shields, ion weapons to strip the enemies' shields and a crew of Zoltan to power it all.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_2_class">Chonkilisk</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_2_name">The Chonkilisk</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_2_desc">The Basilisk, boarding with drones as well as crew: two teleporters with pads for four, two medbays between them, two drones systems with boarding drones, and Mantis.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_2_class">Chonkwalker</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_2_name">The Chonkwalker</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_2_desc">The Stormwalker, seeing everything and healing its own: two sensors, two hacking and two mind control systems, Healing Bursts and missiles, and a crew of Slugs.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_2_class">Chonkivan</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_2_name">The Chonkivan</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_2_desc">The Shivan, burning everything: three weapons systems with fire bombs and missiles, more hull than any other ship its size, Rock Plating and a crew of Rocks.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_2_class">Chonkrike</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_2_name">The Chonkrike</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_LANIUS_2_desc">The Shrike, with no air to breathe: no oxygen system, two backup batteries, two hacking systems, mind control and a teleporter, flak and a crew of Lanius.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_2_class">Chonkelian</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_2_name">The Chonkelian</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_CRYSTAL_2_desc">The Carnelian, boarding unseen: two cloaking systems, a teleporter for Crystal boarders who seal the rooms they land in, Heavy Crystals and a crew of Crystals.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_class">Chonksprey</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_name">The Chonksprey</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_desc">The Osprey, with twice the guns: two Artillery Beams sweeping the enemies' ships, two weapons systems with Burst Lasers, and a Federation crew of every race.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_2_class">Chonknisos</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_2_name">The Chonknisos</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_2_desc">The Nisos, with twice the guns: two Artillery Beams, two weapons systems with Dual Shot Lasers and Leto Missiles, and a Federation crew with a Zoltan and a Slug.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_class">Chonkasio</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_name">The Chonkasio</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_desc">The Nesasio, twice as hard to see: two cloaking systems, to cloak again while one cools down, strong engines and no shields to start with, so it dodges and hides.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_2_class">DA-CHONK 24</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_2_name">DA-CHONK 24</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_2_desc">The DA-SR 12, doubled: two cloaking systems, a Glaive Beam to fire from the dark, no shields to start with, and a crew of humans and Zoltan to power its cloaks.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_3_class">Chonkswallow</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_3_name">The Chonkswallow</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_CHONKESTREL_3_desc">The Swallow, as big as the Chonkestrel: two of most systems, Dual Shot Lasers and Ion Stunners in two weapons systems, a long medbay, and a human crew with two Lanius.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_3_class">Chonkagon</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_3_name">The Chonkagon</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ENGI_3_desc">The Tetragon, with beam drones to spare: three drones systems with beam drones in all of them, the Tetragon's defense scrambler, and Engi with a Lanius to hack.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_3_class">Chonkerenkov</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_3_name">The Chonkerenkov</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ZOLTAN_3_desc">The Cerenkov, run on its crew and its batteries: three shields systems, two backup batteries, two Zoltan shields, Ion Chargers and a crew of Zoltan.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_3_class">Chonkatidae</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_3_name">The Chonkatidae</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_FED_3_desc">The Fregatidae, with two Artillery Beams, a Dual Shot Laser in each weapons system, and a Federation crew of humans with Zoltan and a Mantis.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_3_class">Chonkolimax</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_3_name">The Chonkolimax</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_SLUG_3_desc">The Ariolimax, all eyes and minds: two sensors, two hacking and two mind control systems, all installed, Chain Burst Lasers, and a crew of Slugs.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_3_class">Chonkeseus</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_3_name">The Chonkeseus</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_MANTIS_3_desc">The Theseus, built to board: its teleporter now a pad for eight, a second one for four, two medbays, Lockdown and Stun Bombs, and Mantis with an Engi and a Lanius.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_3_class">Chonktite</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_3_name">The Chonktite</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_ROCK_3_desc">The Tektite, with Rock and Crystal guns: three weapons systems with Swarm Missiles and Heavy Crystals, more hull than any other ship its size, Rock Plating, Rocks and Crystals.</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_3_class">Simo-CHONK</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_3_name">Simo-CHONK</text>
<text name="xftl_ship_PLAYER_SHIP_XFTL_STEALTH_3_desc">The Simo-H, doubled: two cloaking systems, Shield Overchargers instead of shields, a Laser Charger in each weapons system, and a crew of humans with a Rock and a Slug.</text>
